{"server":"cn","storyId":"act29side_level_act29side_07_beg","groupId":"act29side","stageId":"act29side_07","title":"协奏曲“复活”","storyCode":"ZT-7","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act29side/level_act29side_07_beg.txt","sourceHash":"e242f91da43acdd5ad4a74e2036366e4ad950c249b7eaa3250f42429cd78b2f6","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"44_g6_towerterrace"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"崔林特尔梅上空的云......在自由地流动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这就是你最后一刻想要看见的吗，珂拉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“珂拉”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“珂拉”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的琴声让我看见了。真神奇啊，这些画面并不是通过我的眼睛进入脑海的。它们像是从我的心底自己长出来的一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就像你希望的那样，我给了薇薇安娜一些提示。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她那么地渴望待在一名真正的家人身边......可惜她最后依然没有随内心深处最强烈的情感而动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“珂拉”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我的朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“珂拉”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是她对所有人的情感，促使她做出了杀死我的决定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你感到满足？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“珂拉”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么不呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“珂拉”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我正在所爱之人的注视下迎接死亡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“珂拉”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不必为我惋惜。对于像我这样的罪人而言，这已经是最好的结果。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“珂拉”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多亏了你，我和薇薇安娜......都将走到更远的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可要不了多久，你的情感就会彻底消散。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就像一曲终了，弦的振动会保留某种声音，可慢慢地，声音还是会逐渐消逝，最终归于寂静。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“珂拉”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿尔图罗，没有人能留住一朵云。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“珂拉”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人的心灵脆弱而易逝，再强烈的情感，再宏大的愿望，都不可避免地会走向各自的终点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最强大的心灵......也不可以吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“珂拉”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不正是为此而来的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“珂拉”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的全部情感与记忆都留给你了。你找到想要的了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，或许......我马上就能知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“珂拉”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，再见了，阿尔图罗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“珂拉”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"祝你能在旋律中得到答案。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"珂拉·洛文斯坦，我温柔又偏执的朋友......这段旅途有你相伴，我真的很高兴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们想要的未来，我会努力令它实现。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而我和你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......一定会在旋律中再见。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"44_g9_towersquare_arrived"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"珂拉......正在消失？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"离开她！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"布兰特......阁下......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"珂拉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无需对我解释。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你有自己的判断，并......付诸了行动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至于剩下的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......剩下的，我和你，在这个时候，都不能也不该提起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黑焰带走了她。和路德维格大学那时候......很相似。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是赫尔昏佐伦的法术，但并不完全一致。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当时的施术者仅是强行催动术式的仿冒者。而此刻正降下力量的，却仿佛真的是他本人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"红黑色的力量在云层中翻涌。\n它并没有急切地撕扯，侵吞，蔓延。\n它正踱步、环视、等待，就在那云间塔顶的王座上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“巫王的余音”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1126_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们都看到了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“巫王的余音”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1126_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是伟大的赫尔昏佐伦，他听到了我们的呼唤，准允了我们的朝见！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“巫王的余音”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1126_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他正在——向我们垂下通往永恒之塔，始源之角的阶梯！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"巫王的信徒们高声笑着。\n他们纷纷举起乐器，奏出最为凄厉的音符，指向自己的咽喉，刺入自己的胸腹。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"云间的黑色像是有所呼应一般，向他们探出了几缕。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"垂死的信徒亲吻着王对他们伸出的手，与黑焰合而为一，飞向上空，成为盘踞在双子塔上方的，乌云的一部分。\n不成旋律的巨大声响在空中爆裂。\n莱塔尼亚最恐怖也最强大的君主，赫尔昏佐伦，向他的子民发出了诏谕。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"44_g9_towersquare_arrived"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......赫尔昏佐伦，他真的回来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱辛","speakerId":"avg_4011_lessng_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很难对付。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱辛","speakerId":"avg_4011_lessng_1","isRemote":false,"text":"受乐章本身的源石技艺约束，人们还在继续演奏。而改调后的金律乐章正反过来强化赫尔昏佐伦的力量。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱辛","speakerId":"avg_4011_lessng_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你刚刚做了什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"试试看我的法术能不能打到那片云。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱辛","speakerId":"avg_4011_lessng_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在不是发疯的时候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"发疯？我怎么会疯，莱辛，你知道我等这一刻，等了有多久吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"从我的脑子里被灌进那家伙的噪音......不，从我出生开始，就注定了我必须去做这件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你叫我战斗，叫我直视自己身上的责任和罪孽。这很对。赫尔昏佐伦是我背负的罪孽，而直面他就是我的责任。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我得找到一个办法，把他从那天上的行宫......或者随便什么地方揪出来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"或者，我送你们上去？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"透明的丝线从空中伸了出来，搭上他的后颈，轻轻柔柔，凉丝丝的。\n然后，飞快地收紧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谁？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一上来就对刚救了你一命的人大呼小叫，有那么一点不礼貌哦？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黑焰......落在了刚刚我站的地方？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你该听莱辛的话，别跟那团云较劲。他虽然人木头了一点，但说话做事还算牢靠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱辛","speakerId":"avg_4011_lessng_1","isRemote":false,"text":"埃芒加德，你来得很突然。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃芒加德","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在期待一张时刻表吗？我可是从卡兹戴尔赶回来的。我的小方块都被这一路的风摩擦得多了不少线头。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃芒加德","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，帽子也沾到了脏东西。我能在你的角上擦擦吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱辛","speakerId":"avg_4011_lessng_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃芒加德","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱辛","speakerId":"avg_4011_lessng_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......也不要直接对我的角动手。情况有多糟？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃芒加德","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很糟，非常糟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃芒加德","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不需要做任何巫术测试......这片空间里充斥了不该属于这里的丝弦，乱得巫妖都没法厘清。这可不是再下一场雨就能解决的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您也是巫妖？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃芒加德","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很不像吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还以为......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃芒加德","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":false,"text":"巫妖都是白头发老爷爷，一把长胡子，穿着从头遮到尾的法师袍，手里拿着骷髅法杖？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我以为巫妖的言语艺术造诣都很高。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱辛","speakerId":"avg_4011_lessng_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，老爷子呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃芒加德","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老师的脾气你还不了解吗？当然是直接飞到云里去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃芒加德","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫尔昏佐伦刚在王座上一睁眼，他就一步从莱塔尼亚边境上迈了回来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃芒加德","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦对，还扯了扯我们所有人的线头，说不定在卡兹戴尔的巫妖都能听到他的那一声叫骂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱辛","speakerId":"avg_4011_lessng_1","isRemote":false,"text":"来了多少人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃芒加德","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能来的都来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃芒加德","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大家真的很不容易啊，你想想看，昨天刚说了要搬家，那么多的卷轴法器刚装上车，转头就听说原先住的老房子要炸了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃芒加德","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，我都在想啊，你们莱塔尼亚人是不是其实一天都离不开我们巫妖？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"44_g6_towerterrace"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊维格娜德","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"巫妖们回来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫琳玛特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1115_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......情况很严峻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫琳玛特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1115_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“始源之角”......正在降临。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米夏埃尔","speakerId":"avg_4109_baslin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫琳玛特，您的小提琴——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫琳玛特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1115_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫琳玛特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1115_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......莉泽洛特，我们有一阵没有合奏了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊维格娜德","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，乐章的演奏也差不多结束了。按照惯例，本就该轮到我们了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫琳玛特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1115_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫尔昏佐伦......莱塔尼亚注定的灾厄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫琳玛特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1115_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们赢过他一次——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫琳玛特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1115_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——毫无疑问，也会赢第二次。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"44_g9_towersquare_arrived"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是女皇的旋律。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫琳玛特和伊维格娜德......出手了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薇薇安娜，做你该做的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我们也一样。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"金色光辉从金律法卫的剑与盔甲中涌出。\n他的身影几乎消融在了这片辉光中，而同一时刻，其他金律法卫也响应着女皇们的旋律。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"法术的光芒从各个角落射向天空，彼此靠近，相互联结。\n天空已被黑色遮蔽，但更为绚丽的云霞正从地面升起。\n在这片金色的拱卫下，管风琴的声音轻柔地罩住了双塔下的人们，小提琴清澈又激昂的乐声则化作利剑，刺向翻滚的云层。\n而另有数十只手牵出万千丝弦，拨弄天空与风中的旋律，让它们变得更为清晰。\n双子女皇，金律法卫，巫妖。\n莱塔尼亚的守卫者们站在了一起，协力对抗着从虚空中归来的，莱塔尼亚过去的王。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"44_g9_towersquare_arrived"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"混乱仍在加剧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能够对抗赫尔昏佐伦的，只有女皇的旋律。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"旋律......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"除了管风琴和小提琴的声音，还有大提琴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，我并没有听见。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因为它是噪声的一部分，和传统的乐声有很大差异。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们习惯于感受音乐，而我会无差别地接收所有声音。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"结论无比清晰——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是阿尔图罗。她越狱了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“巫王的余音”？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1126_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（尖锐的杂音）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......这是什么？落下的黑焰......有了人形？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是源石技艺的造物，还是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃芒加德","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":false,"text":"令人遗憾的事实。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃芒加德","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我刚用巫术刺探过它们。这些法术能量之中，还留存着些许人类的感情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱辛","speakerId":"avg_4011_lessng_1","isRemote":false,"text":"难道它们还以某种形式活着？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃芒加德","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然......不可能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃芒加德","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即便是一直与死亡打着交道的我们，也做不到在肉体灵魂全都湮灭后，依然活下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃芒加德","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们所见到的不过是一点点生前的残留，用这群癫狂的信徒自己的话说——“余音”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......他们大概也算是得偿所愿了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃芒加德","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这不是什么好讯息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃芒加德","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":false,"text":"类似的“余音”往往只会出现在......呃，怎么解释比较好？就是一片我们的血肉和其余有形之物都无法存在的空间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃芒加德","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在那个空间，没有“生”和“死”的概念，也不会有时间流动，只有信息能留下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃芒加德","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“余音”就是信息的残迹，正常情况下，在现实中只会是停滞的幻觉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃芒加德","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我刚刚在黑焰中摸到的感情是还在流动的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱辛","speakerId":"avg_4011_lessng_1","isRemote":false,"text":"直接说结论吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃芒加德","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":false,"text":"笨木头，真没耐心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃芒加德","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，谁让你们不是巫妖。总之，空间的侵蚀在加剧。而且赫尔昏佐伦对那个空间的改造很成功，大概至今仍将自己的意识保存于其中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......您刚刚说，我们能到上面去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃芒加德","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可以哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃芒加德","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，你们真要去吗？我刚刚说过了，除了赫尔昏佐伦，还没人进去过哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他能“存在”，我为什么不能试试？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃芒加德","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，年轻人就是有朝气。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃芒加德","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在卡兹戴尔和那些暮气沉沉的老家伙还有垂头丧气的雇佣兵待久了，都忘了莱塔尼亚人可以这么有意思了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃芒加德","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可惜的是，就连巫妖都没有把活人送进那个空间的方法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃芒加德","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要进入“始源之角”，需要两个空间有稳定的联系，类似我在这里呼喊老师，老师给予我回应。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵，那些戴面具的疯子的呼喊，竟然真能唤醒那家伙？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱辛","speakerId":"avg_4011_lessng_1","isRemote":false,"text":"绝无可能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱辛","speakerId":"avg_4011_lessng_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在这十多年里，老爷子试了各种方法，从萨卡兹远古巫术试到莱塔尼亚最新的术式，均以失败告终。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃芒加德","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他呀，曾经都打算把巫妖的圣殿开到崔林特尔梅来了，直到被其他老师联手阻止了才罢休。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱辛","speakerId":"avg_4011_lessng_1","isRemote":false,"text":"埃芒加德，你能摸到问题源头所在的位置吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃芒加德","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们都能看见啊，双子女皇塔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃芒加德","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塔里有那么多人在呢，你想让我们把两座塔一起打包放逐吗？这倒是一点都不难。放逐整个崔林特尔梅也可以哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱辛","speakerId":"avg_4011_lessng_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别开这种玩笑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃芒加德","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好啦。真到了那个时候，也轮不到我们巫妖来出手吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃芒加德","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们的金律法卫都把帷幕拉起来了。真到了“始源之角”失控，到了连双子女皇都无法挽回的地步，他们会怎么做？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......他们会让双塔连同剧场一起湮灭。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“巫王的余音”？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1126_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（尖锐的杂音）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱辛","speakerId":"avg_4011_lessng_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又来了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵，巫王残党......就算死透了，还是要纠缠不清。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱辛","speakerId":"avg_4011_lessng_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里交给我和埃芒加德。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱辛","speakerId":"avg_4011_lessng_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你去双子女皇塔，把进入“始源之角”的路找出来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱辛","speakerId":"avg_4011_lessng_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拿上这个。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是什么......布带做的绳结？该死，别给我留任何纪念品。我不需要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱辛","speakerId":"avg_4011_lessng_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是纪念品，是一种特殊的通讯器。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱辛","speakerId":"avg_4011_lessng_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是巫妖的习惯，他们依靠丝弦在彼此之间传递信息。我不会萨卡兹巫术，只能依托实物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱辛","speakerId":"avg_4011_lessng_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看好，只要像这样，轻轻拉一下绳结，我和埃芒加德就能接收到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你最好......真的能收到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃芒加德","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好啦，死不掉的，别啰啰嗦嗦了。最多受点重伤，我也很快就能给他修补好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱辛","speakerId":"avg_4011_lessng_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黑键，你有你要面对的，但我要守护的都在下面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱辛","speakerId":"avg_4011_lessng_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有，需要有人为你守住后背，以及退路。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"知道了，我争取活着回来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱辛","speakerId":"avg_4011_lessng_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你会做到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也是。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"44_g5_spiralstairs"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......谁？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萨科塔......还有女皇的术师？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您好，我是薇薇安娜·德罗斯特。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"女皇的术师们都在下方的廊桥位置，随女皇一同对抗赫尔昏佐伦。我没想到，能在这一层遇见其他人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......黑键干员。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您叫我......什么？等等，您也是罗德岛的人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是拉特兰公证所执行者，与罗德岛签署过清理协议。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在罗德岛的时候，出于控制风险的考量，我被允许阅读部分干员的个人档案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛......吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也有好几位朋友，与罗德岛关系匪浅呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是不是意味着，我们可以同行？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“巫王的余音”？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1126_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（尖锐的杂音）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......追到这里来了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们听到了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就在上方，接近塔顶的位置......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，越来越清晰了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大提琴的声音？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，这就是阿尔图罗的琴声。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"44_g6_towerterrace"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"narration","text":"露台上下起了一场浅灰色的雨。在即将落到阿尔图罗的琴弦上之前，雨滴们又迅速地倒流，生长成一朵近在眼前的云。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"......或者，一个烟圈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那两只羊的防御术式果然挡不住我的烟圈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我本以为......来的第一位听众，会是我那位执着的弟弟呢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗莱蒙特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1114_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行了行了，小萨科塔，没人想听你拉琴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"弗莱蒙特阁下，您不是也一直想进入“始源之角”吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有......那位“无情权威”。你们想解决赫尔昏佐伦遗留的麻烦，可在内心深处，你们也都还有着其他渴望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫琳玛特想要更强大的力量，而您的想法......啊，多么深刻的情感。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"作为巫王曾经最亲密的挚友，哲思的碰撞，法术的交融......二位的友谊，恰与莱塔尼亚那段辉煌的年月同调。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而同行后的歧路，则让故友的重逢更加值得期待，不是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗莱蒙特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1114_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你乱说什......你在读我的想法？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗莱蒙特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1114_1","isRemote":false,"text":"连魔王都不敢轻易翻开我的书卷，你会遭天谴的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您的心声正随我的琴音共振。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我并不能选择性地忽视您的心灵发出的声响，正如大多数人都听得见我的琴音。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗莱蒙特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1114_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原来这就是你的小把戏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗莱蒙特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1114_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的琴声就是那把钥匙。什么赫尔昏佐伦的旋律，根本就和他随手写下的乐谱无关！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“背叛者的灵魂将引领他们找到遗失的‘始源之角’。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"希曼，洛里斯，布兰特，格哈德，最后......是珂拉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在他们情感的最深处，找到了巫王的遗言。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗莱蒙特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1114_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你能听到那家伙临死时发出的胡言乱语，挺好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗莱蒙特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1114_1","isRemote":false,"text":"让莱塔尼亚给你发个奖章怎么样？你可以滚回你的拉特兰去了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一团灰色的云雾出现在阿尔图罗脚下。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"它很快炸开了，将萨科塔连同她的琴一起吞了个干净。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，弗莱蒙特阁下。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不能停下来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我需要见一见......赫尔昏佐伦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想演奏他。我想感受他度过的一生，死亡那一刻的所思所想，以及......死后依然回荡在整个莱塔尼亚上空的强烈情感。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我需要从他身上得到一个答案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗莱蒙特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1114_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萨科塔，这些徒有其表的法术只会让你死得更快。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“格哈德”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1124_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我努力过了，老师。我埋首于高塔中的经卷，想从典籍中寻求一个答案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“格哈德”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1124_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其他人的生命都是那么脆弱，只要做出一个错误的决策，就可能走向消亡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“格哈德”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1124_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而赫尔昏佐伦，在他死后，他的意志依旧如永恒的高塔般屹立不倒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“格哈德”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1124_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么赫尔昏佐伦如此特殊？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“莉泽洛特”","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫尔昏佐伦真的能被杀死吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“莉泽洛特”","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我和希尔德加德身体里有他的术式。我们俩是被制造出来的，对付他的兵器。只有人造的兵器才能夺走的生命，还是普通生命吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“莉泽洛特”","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们说，是您告诉了赫尔昏佐伦关于“永恒”的秘密。他躲在一片不在这片大地上的帷幕背后，也躲过了死亡的凝视。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“莉泽洛特”","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是一个什么样的空间？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“埃芒加德”","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老师，数千年来，我们巫妖一直在研究那片“空间”......如果那真的是一片“空间”的话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“埃芒加德”","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我们从来没有人进去过。只有赫尔昏佐伦，他踏了进去，掌握了比我们所知更多的真相。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“埃芒加德”","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......您不好奇吗？您不想把“始源之角”夺过来，把它变成巫妖自己的东西吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“埃芒加德”","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们可以把里面的知识全部带回地面。萨卡兹会用得上的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“埃芒加德”","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":false,"text":"危险？我们没有必要听那对双子的呀。莱塔尼亚又不是我们的国家。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“弗莱蒙特”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1114_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可危险来自那片空间本身。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“弗莱蒙特”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1114_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虚空......无穷无尽的......邪魔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“弗莱蒙特”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1114_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虚空从来不是......空的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“弗莱蒙特”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1114_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有太多东西。太多危险......不可知的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“弗莱蒙特”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1114_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗莱蒙特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1114_1","isRemote":false,"text":"够了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......刚刚那抹黑色是什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"弗莱蒙特阁下，是您......上一次“死亡”时的情境吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您窥见了......虚空。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就差一点点，您就要被吞没了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗莱蒙特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1114_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我听说，巫妖有一些特殊的手段，可以使得生命接近无限地延续下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即便如此，在面对肉身的消亡时，您依然会......感到恐惧吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗莱蒙特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1114_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在谈论一些你无法理解，也不该理解的事物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......为什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们的生命如此短暂，为何活该一无所知地走向终局？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗莱蒙特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1114_1","isRemote":false,"text":"禁忌不可被轻易触碰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗莱蒙特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1114_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿尔图罗，你不愿意放弃，那就死在这里。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"成千上万的丝线从巫妖身后的虚空坠下，比狂风更快，比暴雨更密。\n它们缠住阿尔图罗的大提琴，试图按住她的琴弓与琴弦，扯住她的双手和身躯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“放逐”。\n老巫妖并不打算让她滚回拉特兰了，他想要她彻底消失。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"阿尔图罗微微笑着，也许是最后一次，她拉动琴弓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"弗莱蒙特阁下，请原谅我的无知与狂妄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我宁可下一秒就死去，宁可坠入虚空，宁可化为混沌......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......也绝不会停止演奏。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"最后一个音符响起。\n在被无尽的虚空吞噬之前，阿尔图罗很清楚，这场演奏已经完成了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱辛","speakerId":"avg_4011_lessng_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......埃芒加德，你看到了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃芒加德","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多谢提醒。在我的眼睛看清楚之前，那么多线已经震得快把我的灵魂颠出身体了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱辛","speakerId":"avg_4011_lessng_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这就是“始源之角”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱辛","speakerId":"avg_4011_lessng_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看起来......和传说中的巫王塔那么相似。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"乌云裂开了。\n如同有一只巨大的眼睛，正在虚空中缓缓睁开。\n而那瞳仁深处映照的并非他物，正是二十三年前那座漆黑的塔。\n它甚至就在当年的位置，如今的双子塔的正中。\n始源之塔真的倒下过吗？\n巫王赫尔昏佐伦真的死去过吗？\n这笼罩于莱塔尼亚人心头的梦魇，会不会并非去而复返，而是从未消散？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"44_g5_spiralstairs"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大提琴声消失了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......阿尔图罗。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，费德里科先生！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......绳结在动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我感受到了莱辛和巫妖的警示。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这片空间有些异常。德罗斯特女士，熄灭您的烛火......也不要使用别的源石技艺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不能确定，接下来会发生什么......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"44_g10_endlessspiral"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"楼梯......发生了变化？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是什么特别的法术吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是阿尔图罗小姐的琴声造成的错觉......还是别的什么力量？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......黑键先生？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只有隐约的脚步声......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"很快，就连脚步声都消失不见。\n螺旋楼梯还在继续延伸，延伸，直到看不见尽头。\n自己究竟是在向上走，还是向下走？\n薇薇安娜感到一丝恍惚。\n她唯一能确定的是，走在台阶上的，只剩下她一个人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
